      "id": "prologue",
      "year": "杭州",
      "title": "一城山水",
      "en": "A CITY SHAPED BY WATER",
      "lines": [
        [
          "杭州，一面是西湖，一面是钱塘江。",
          "Hangzhou: West Lake on one side, Qiantang River on the other."
        ],
        [
          "这座城的年轮，就藏在湖与江之间。",
          "The rings of the city lie between lake and river."
        ]
      ],
      "start": 0,
      "end": 11.682375
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "year": "589",
      "title": "杭州之名",
      "en": "THE NAME HANGZHOU",
      "lines": [
        [
          "公元五百八十九年，隋朝设置杭州。",
          "The Sui established Hangzhou in 589."
        ],
        [
          "城市，依着西湖东岸展开。",
          "The city grew east of West Lake."
        ]
      ],
      "start": 11.682375,
      "end": 20.089916666666667
    },
